{"sessionId":"L1-S20","number":20,"sessionTitle":"Bump, Then Think","title":"The Hedge Maze","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 20. The Hedge Maze.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/title.ogg","dur":2.852,"env":"0004qr50psprrnywuyj2h2galvrrtjaagsold000000000007fzzsjjrzyg4goi5tvxurppqrtodji70000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.9],["20.",0.9,1.23],["The",1.6,1.88],["Hedge",1.88,2.28],["Maze.",2.28,2.62]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"The robot learned to feel with a bumper. Ten lights! But Bolt ran into the foggy maze…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/prev.ogg","dur":7.166,"env":"000nzzyvtunike0ke00lcvxvtstsrtqk500000000002zrtzzzq3mvoa7c7rwvyuvfbbdl324oywwxwwngznt9kzxruth3dqplc00000000000ihzzzzzztzvvuttpb00blljgb20000000000sn0g8006zxvvtk5c5jyzswuvvuvustudcrtp554tyo6auutttsrpoqqlelia000000000","words":[["Last",0.1,0.59],["time...",0.59,1.08],["The",1.46,1.64],["robot",1.64,1.91],["learned",1.91,2.27],["to",2.27,2.41],["feel",2.41,2.64],["with",2.64,2.87],["a",2.87,2.97],["bumper.",2.97,3.29],["Ten",3.67,3.98],["lights!",3.98,4.5],["But",4.87,5.11],["Bolt",5.11,5.42],["ran",5.42,5.66],["into",5.66,5.96],["the",5.96,6.21],["foggy",6.21,6.56],["maze…",6.56,6.86]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"The foggy hedge maze behind Nana’s garden. Tall green hedges, white fog.","action":"From somewhere deep inside: “Woof! Woof!” Amara peers in.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Bolt is somewhere in the maze. I can’t see the paths!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/0.ogg","dur":3.947,"env":"0000000zzzydnxqknnuqzzstuurvwzwpwwomkjfgda8jfb500000000000000000000iutr2jqzxprdcfuxxtptc5nzzstnkh3008jhh840000000000000","words":[["Bolt",0.24,0.46],["is",0.46,0.6],["somewhere",0.6,1.03],["in",1.03,1.17],["the",1.17,1.35],["maze.",1.35,1.57],["I",2.2,2.35],["can’t",2.35,2.66],["see",2.66,2.91],["the",2.91,3.17],["paths!",3.17,3.54]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":1,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"We could count hops… but we don’t have a map of this maze.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/1.ogg","dur":4.112,"env":"02ryi7tk640arsoqphi967oqni8428kpe200000000nvssh550rtgd4owqnkihc863000000000guiawmhermmnm55ho842jtpdjm39fljkhe5653ahca0000000","words":[["We",0.08,0.25],["could",0.25,0.56],["count",0.56,0.87],["hops…",0.87,1.14],["but",1.42,1.7],["we",1.7,1.91],["don’t",1.91,2.25],["have",2.25,2.58],["a",2.58,2.74],["map",2.74,3.01],["of",3.01,3.22],["this",3.22,3.56],["maze.",3.56,3.9]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"At the maze entrance. Nana Lucía puts one hand on the right-hand hedge.","action":"She walks slowly. Each time she meets a hedge in front, she turns right. A dotted line shows her path winding inward.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":2,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"In this maze, I have one rule. If I bump into a hedge… I turn right.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/2.ogg","dur":6.498,"env":"00dtuttusizzqowtsagrupopnpmmiilrrpg400000000000ltqmnzladknwsprrsrnlnvzzzxrqpkje800000000000004obbcqtun830lxtrolol5gslpn6q763ttpljhghussoml654inklf40000000000000etvl0mqb9yvuvvwvutssstsm70gk7000000","words":[["In",0.1,0.37],["this",0.37,0.81],["maze,",0.81,1.24],["I",1.24,1.43],["have",1.43,1.87],["one",1.87,2.22],["rule.",2.22,2.65],["If",3.14,3.37],["I",3.37,3.54],["bump",3.54,3.91],["into",3.91,4.27],["a",4.27,4.44],["hedge…",4.44,4.87],["I",5.36,5.52],["turn",5.52,5.87],["right.",5.87,6.29]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":3,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"I don’t need the map. I just need my rule.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/3.ogg","dur":3.151,"env":"000lsiytsi6dsvuc6krtrqqoonk7036000000000000000sxrbhpzvnrl3wzzzzm7mzyuuuvuqqxzzyvwttuutsn8000000","words":[["I",0.11,0.22],["don’t",0.22,0.45],["need",0.45,0.68],["the",0.68,0.86],["map.",0.86,1.05],["I",1.54,1.69],["just",1.69,2.04],["need",2.04,2.38],["my",2.38,2.6],["rule.",2.6,2.94]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"A big glowing “IF” sign floats over the robot, like a road sign.","action":"Two paths split from the sign: one where the bumper clicks (the robot backs off and turns), one where nothing touches (the robot keeps going).","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":4,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"If is a choice. IF I feel a bump, I back off and turn right.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/4.ogg","dur":4.704,"env":"06yt566650mwmtvq4kmmzxpia6lpqod3200000000irttzzc766vnom9753dopslioyfb5pqogeh80500000000003lqrrn7tstl57mrrb7hohd2qcdqmojhgbbkolmoga700c3000000","words":[["If",0.08,0.28],["is",0.28,0.49],["a",0.49,0.64],["choice.",0.64,1.08],["IF",1.38,1.6],["I",1.6,1.76],["feel",1.76,2.12],["a",2.12,2.28],["bump,",2.28,2.63],["I",2.63,2.79],["back",2.79,3.15],["off",3.15,3.44],["and",3.44,3.72],["turn",3.72,4.08],["right.",4.08,4.5]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":5,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"If I don’t feel a bump, I just keep creeping on.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/5.ogg","dur":3.014,"env":"02tm34zuvscqofmj63223jnormjfeshc50zwlfa32007qrsrj6crzujih933fuk30066arnlg43oidbggga30000000","words":[["If",0.08,0.26],["I",0.26,0.39],["don’t",0.39,0.68],["feel",0.68,0.97],["a",0.97,1.1],["bump,",1.1,1.39],["I",1.39,1.52],["just",1.52,1.8],["keep",1.8,2.09],["creeping",2.09,2.59],["on.",2.59,2.77]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":6,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Sense. Think. Act! The “if” is the thinking part!","direction":"Pause: let children say “Sense, think, act!”.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/6.ogg","dur":3.902,"env":"04mrshxtmjegc5tkkha200000000czyulj5b8300000000cjjijh530mh5000000009vuwxk7iutspnm43n932nzwik7enlj30gzzxrm9640ic0000000","words":[["Sense.",0.06,0.65],["Think.",0.95,1.26],["Act!",1.56,1.95],["The",2.25,2.45],["“if”",2.45,2.61],["is",2.61,2.78],["the",2.78,2.98],["thinking",2.98,3.42],["part!",3.42,3.68]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Inside the maze, robot’s-eye view: hedge, fog, hedge.","action":"The robot creeps, bumps, backs off, turns, creeps. Bolt’s barks get louder. In the middle sits Bolt, wagging, next to a glowing puddle of fog.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":7,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Bump. Turn. Bump. Turn… Found you, Bolt!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/7.ogg","dur":3.647,"env":"00bwuspb00000000000005ilmkqnhd20000000000vvttd20000000000003mnkjkomib20000000000lrsslfgkljd4000009uxwrh3000000","words":[["Bump.",0.1,0.35],["Turn.",0.72,1.0],["Bump.",1.38,1.62],["Turn…",1.98,2.31],["Found",2.68,2.98],["you,",2.98,3.19],["Bolt!",3.19,3.44]],"voice":"myrobot"},{"i":8,"who":"bolt","guestName":null,"text":"Beep-woof!","direction":"Licks the robot’s bumper.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/8.ogg","dur":1.525,"env":"0rtvs8ovvi0000002kxwzzzl7754676430000000000000","words":[["Beep",0.06,0.33],["woof!",0.41,1.28]],"voice":"bolt"}]},{"setting":"Edge of the maze. Faint music drifts up the hill. Through the fog, a pale glow above the bandstand in the town square.","action":"Something on the bandstand roof flickers — then a ringing sound: “ting… ting…”.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":9,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Listen! Something is ringing on the bandstand.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/9.ogg","dur":3.618,"env":"00220000dzzzstkyxxxzzx643220000000000000000003cnnzwzoyxzzvljvwxzzyyyvpywsigsqqszmpj8mlgbdkl3a2200000000000000","words":[["Listen!",0.07,1.05],["Something",1.53,1.98],["is",1.98,2.13],["ringing",2.13,2.5],["on",2.5,2.65],["the",2.65,2.84],["bandstand.",2.84,3.29]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":10,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"I hear it — but in this fog I can’t see how far away it is.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/10.ogg","dur":4.595,"env":"04ozwtg77ispusqlpka0bie000000000awuri4300000npnmivsdrs920kyurlpoph44200jorg488qnf400drrkqtsg6fol846zzwxxtwwwhgutsrqul7bssnmkfa9hkhd2000000","words":[["I",0.07,0.23],["hear",0.23,0.6],["it",0.6,0.83],["—",0.83,0.93],["but",0.93,1.23],["in",1.23,1.46],["this",1.46,1.83],["fog",1.83,2.12],["I",2.12,2.29],["can’t",2.29,2.66],["see",2.66,2.96],["how",2.96,3.25],["far",3.25,3.55],["away",3.55,3.92],["it",3.92,4.15],["is.",4.15,4.38]],"voice":"spark"}]}],"cliffhanger":{"text":"Something glows and rings on the bandstand in the fog. Can a robot “hear” how far away things are?","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S20/next.ogg","dur":7.005,"env":"000szxt98krl3ji00mezzyyxwxwwvt8000000000009kexzk4mvxvbczwzzzzzrquvthhfnqstl8cmyuttttujepqqtsr7azuuutuwr9klb3putnkyuwxvt8755vvspppg08000000000000007rzzvqzzzr4tvndcffzwvyrqzzq888uzxvvzxxywb4hvtwvscewtsqrnc2000000","words":[["Next",0.11,0.57],["time...",0.57,1.03],["Something",1.4,1.93],["glows",1.93,2.26],["and",2.26,2.49],["rings",2.49,2.82],["on",2.82,3.0],["the",3.0,3.23],["bandstand",3.23,3.76],["in",3.76,3.93],["the",3.93,4.16],["fog.",4.16,4.39],["Can",4.87,5.06],["a",5.06,5.16],["robot",5.16,5.43],["“hear”",5.43,5.66],["how",5.66,5.85],["far",5.85,6.04],["away",6.04,6.27],["things",6.27,6.58],["are?",6.58,6.76]],"voice":"narrator"},"voicedSec":59.7}